{
 "sig": "67fe8e661754",
 "text": "The division had pushed only its 2nd Regiment forward to an outpost line, keeping the 7th and 19th on the main line of resistance behind. On May 18th, Chinese company-sized forces tried several times to cross the river by day, and every attempt was beaten back. Then before dawn on the 19th, mistaking the outpost for the main line, the Chinese began throwing in the main bodies of the 187th and 188th Divisions at once.",
